{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:26 2026-11-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:26 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:26 2026-11-11 HKT</p><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/6bd09804bae9d07c537a6841fff1fe57/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_09_12_50_1_.jpeg\"/><p>中西區海濱長廊西區副食品批發市場段2-3號碼頭間，今（11日）早上7時44分，有途人發現一名男子在對開海面載浮載沉，報警求助，救援人員接報到場，將年約40歲的南亞裔男事主救起，他已陷入昏迷，被送往瑪麗醫院，惜經搶救後證實不治。現場警員在場搜索死者的財物，並調查其身份及其墮海原因。</p><img alt=\"警員在場搜索事主的財物。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c4e17b4648d57906fea2f1a86ab91c3f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_09_12_52_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/18b48ab9782c49cd504300e0028b0c4b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_09_12_52.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2b69cf9de600480e3d1b9faeb1bf7d20/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_09_12_51_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/badbb954b562332fd0a28df7a847e1a1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_09_12_51.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8009e8e50c18fa2a3217634de6af086f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_09_12_49.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ea14630fa7b41df9c20fe18f8731fd3a/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_09_12_48.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:50:13.866176+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":223,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T01:26:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T03:04:49.848206+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T01:43:50.164037+00:00","content_hash":"dc5e4292b3f601fc01ba618b235826fc5953f1e58cb93706943036e71331632d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}